  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526344",
      "title": "Adding & Styling Tabs",
      "lectureOrder": 135,
      "videoOrder": 117,
      "sourceHash": "aed89435c601b31d4937a3b90c6284400d3001c1ea1dffc7c7a70b2e37bd618d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.58,
          "end": 5.26,
          "en": "To work around that we got two options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.26,
          "end": 9.07,
          "en": "Option one, is that we pass our props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.07,
          "end": 11.29,
          "en": "to the dynamically rendered component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.29,
          "end": 14.43,
          "en": "There actually is a syntax we could use for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.43,
          "end": 17.86,
          "en": "and I did add a text lecture about this syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.86,
          "end": 22.41,
          "en": "in the last module, after D dynamic component lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.41,
          "end": 23.97,
          "en": "But I'll not use it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.97,
          "end": 26.87,
          "en": "Instead, I'll use that provide inject feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.87,
          "end": 31.28,
          "en": "we learned about, so that we also can practice this again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.28,
          "end": 34.48,
          "en": "And for that, I first of all wanna move,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.48,
          "end": 38.08,
          "en": "my stored resources from App.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.08,
          "end": 41.66,
          "en": "So move this key NDRA,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.66,
          "end": 44.55,
          "en": "and bring it to TheResources.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 46.45,
          "en": "That of course means that we can now get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.45,
          "end": 48.97,
          "en": "of the data property, in App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.97,
          "end": 51.533,
          "en": "because we no longer have any data in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.42,
          "end": 56.37,
          "en": "But now in TheResources.vue, in this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.37,
          "end": 58.13,
          "en": "we can add this key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.13,
          "end": 61.163,
          "en": "We can add the stored resources to our data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.37,
          "end": 66.02,
          "en": "and now I wanna provide those stored resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.02,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "so that in the stored resources component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 71.03,
          "en": "I can inject them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.03,
          "end": 72.6,
          "en": "And you'll learn how that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.6,
          "end": 75.11,
          "en": "For this, we can now add the provide key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.11,
          "end": 78.12,
          "en": "and add it in its method form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.12,
          "end": 80.6,
          "en": "so that the we return an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.6,
          "end": 82.92,
          "en": "where we can provide our resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.92,
          "end": 85.58,
          "en": "and point at the stored resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.58,
          "end": 87.503,
          "en": "we have in our data property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.66,
          "end": 91.48,
          "en": "And with that we're providing the resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.48,
          "end": 94.21000000000001,
          "en": "to all lower level components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.21000000000001,
          "end": 96.34,
          "en": "So, to all child components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.34,
          "end": 99.023,
          "en": "and child components of child components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.15,
          "end": 103.06,
          "en": "And that means that in stored resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.06,
          "end": 105.71000000000001,
          "en": "we now only need to change one thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.71000000000001,
          "end": 108.37,
          "en": "Instead of getting resources as props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.37,
          "end": 110.223,
          "en": "we need to inject them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.14,
          "end": 114.41,
          "en": "So that we inject this resources key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.41,
          "end": 117.07,
          "en": "and that is the key I'm providing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.07,
          "end": 120.49,
          "en": "and with that, we get access to those resources here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.49,
          "end": 121.943,
          "en": "just like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.19,
          "end": 125.38,
          "en": "So now with all of that done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.38,
          "end": 128.27,
          "en": "I of course need to go back to App.vue though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.27,
          "end": 131.95,
          "en": "and use TheResources component we've been working on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.95,
          "end": 133.957,
          "en": "So import TheResources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.095,
          "end": 140.095,
          "en": "from ./components- learning resources/TheResources.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.85,
          "end": 145.01,
          "en": "and register this as a local component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.01,
          "end": 147.24,
          "en": "in the app config object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.24,
          "end": 149.47,
          "en": "So that here in the app template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.47,
          "end": 151.557,
          "en": "we can render TheResources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.46,
          "end": 153.663,
          "en": "and hence surrender this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.663,
          "end": 155.423,
          "en": "that we've just been working on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.03,
          "end": 158.42000000000002,
          "en": "And with that if we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.42000000000002,
          "end": 160.67000000000002,
          "en": "here we got our tabs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.67000000000002,
          "end": 163.01,
          "en": "and we can switch between these two components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.01,
          "end": 166.19299999999998,
          "en": "and we see the stored resources there as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.04,
          "end": 170.36,
          "en": "Now, let's maybe highlight which tab is currently selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.36,
          "end": 172.94,
          "en": "Because currently that's not easy to see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.94,
          "end": 176.54,
          "en": "and thereafter let's of course, work on adding resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.54,
          "end": 179.11,
          "en": "But to quickly highlight these select the tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.11,
          "end": 181.46,
          "en": "we can go to TheResources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.46,
          "end": 183.52,
          "en": "which is where we have these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 183.52,
          "end": 185.77,
          "en": "And in there, I can set the mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.77,
          "end": 188.483,
          "en": "depending on which resource is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.01,
          "end": 193.72,
          "en": "So I will bind the mode here of is first button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.72,
          "end": 197.26,
          "en": "which is used for selecting the stored resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 197.26,
          "end": 199.74,
          "en": "and check if the selected tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.74,
          "end": 203.03,
          "en": "is equal to stored-resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.03,
          "end": 206.2,
          "en": "If it is, I wanna use the default button style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.2,
          "end": 208.12,
          "en": "So then I'll set the mode to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.12,
          "end": 211.11,
          "en": "and not pass in any note mode at all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.11,
          "end": 213.43,
          "en": "but otherwise I'll set it to flat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.43,
          "end": 215.7,
          "en": "So that if the other tab is selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.7,
          "end": 217.973,
          "en": "this first button has the flat style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.82999999999998,
          "end": 221.66,
          "en": "And since having all the logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.66,
          "end": 223.38,
          "en": "in the template is a bit ugly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.38,
          "end": 225.35,
          "en": "though it's also not horrible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 225.35,
          "end": 226.79,
          "en": "but since I don't want to have it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 226.79,
          "end": 230.34,
          "en": "I'll grab it and instead add a computed property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.34,
          "end": 235.21,
          "en": "So here, I'll add computed, the computed option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 235.21,
          "end": 237.953,
          "en": "and add the storedResButtonMode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.95,
          "end": 242.46,
          "en": "and return this result here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.46,
          "end": 245.633,
          "en": "Now of course, referring to this selected tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 247.22,
          "end": 250.51,
          "en": "And we can also already add the addResButtonMode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 252.26,
          "end": 255.11,
          "en": "and here return this selected tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.11,
          "end": 258.49,
          "en": "checking if it's equal to add-resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 258.49,
          "end": 260.27,
          "en": "And if it is, we'll set it to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.27,
          "end": 262.373,
          "en": "otherwise we'll use this flat mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 263.77,
          "end": 266.203,
          "en": "And now we've got these two computed properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267.58,
          "end": 270.57,
          "en": "We can now use them in the template to bind to mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270.57,
          "end": 274.69,
          "en": "So here mode is bound to storedResButtonMode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.176,
          "end": 277.203,
          "en": "and on the other button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 277.203,
          "end": 280.28,
          "en": "the mode is bound to the addResButtonMode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 280.28,
          "end": 282.923,
          "en": "To the other computed property therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 285.04,
          "end": 289.67,
          "en": "And now with that out of the way, this looks much nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 289.67,
          "end": 293.19,
          "en": "So let's next work on this add resource screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 293.19,
          "end": 296.193,
          "en": "and let's make sure we can add resources.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
